WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.541 --> 00:00:32.750
<b>In the previous verses,</b>

2
00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:35.958
<b>we learned about Lord Krishna's avatar. </b>

3
00:00:35.958 --> 00:00:40.500
<b>We learned when and where He manifests,</b>

4
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.416
<b>and why He takes these avatars.</b>

5
00:00:43.416 --> 00:00:46.125
<b>Now in this verse, we'll learn</b>

6
00:00:46.125 --> 00:00:48.541
<b>that when one truly understands</b>

7
00:00:48.541 --> 00:00:53.916
<b>and accepts in their heart the truth about </b>
<b>these avatars or births of Lord Krishna,</b>

8
00:00:53.916 --> 00:00:55.916
<b>what do they receive?</b>

9
00:01:00.791 --> 00:01:07.250
<b>We learned earlier that whenever dharma </b>
<b>declines and unrighteousness rises,</b>

10
00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:10.625
<b>Krishna takes birth in the form of an avatar,</b>

11
00:01:10.625 --> 00:01:18.916
<b>with the purpose of protecting devotees, </b>
<b>destroying evil, and establishing dharma.</b>

12
00:01:18.916 --> 00:01:26.208
<b>Now this verse mentions another crucial purpose </b>
<b>of Krishna's manifestation.</b>

13
00:01:26.208 --> 00:01:27.708
<b>Krishna says – </b>

14
00:01:27.708 --> 00:01:28.833
<b>O Arjuna,</b>

15
00:01:28.833 --> 00:01:33.125
<b>one who understands the divine </b>
<b>nature of my birth and actions</b>

16
00:01:33.125 --> 00:01:38.166
<b>does not take birth again in this </b>
<b>material world after death,</b>

17
00:01:38.166 --> 00:01:38.875
<b>but</b>

18
00:01:38.875 --> 00:01:41.000
<b>attains Me instead.</b>

19
00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:47.500
<b>This means that those who are devoted </b>
<b>and surrendered to Krishna with faith,</b>

20
00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:51.625
<b>who believe in His divine nature</b>
<b>and His divine play,</b>

21
00:01:51.625 --> 00:01:56.875
<b>Krishna has come to free them </b>
<b>from birth and death as well.</b>

22
00:01:56.875 --> 00:01:59.750
<b>And how is this possible?</b>

23
00:01:59.750 --> 00:02:01.583
<b>Let's understand.</b>

24
00:02:01.583 --> 00:02:02.416
<b>Because</b>

25
00:02:02.416 --> 00:02:07.333
<b>if our surrender and faith are in these </b>
<b>avatars and their divine play,</b>

26
00:02:07.333 --> 00:02:08.875
<b>it means the</b>

27
00:02:08.875 --> 00:02:16.250
<b>mind has risen above material nature and </b>
<b>has begun to understand spiritual truth.</b>

28
00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:19.416
<b>And one who has fully understood this truth</b>

29
00:02:19.416 --> 00:02:23.708
<b>becomes worthy of liberation</b>
<b>from the bonds of karma.</b>

30
00:02:23.708 --> 00:02:26.041
<b>Those who believe only in materiality</b>

31
00:02:26.041 --> 00:02:30.291
<b>will find the Lord's transcendental </b>
<b>pastimes unbelievable.</b>

32
00:02:30.291 --> 00:02:33.291
<b>Complete devotion and </b>
<b>spiritual surrender are needed</b>

33
00:02:33.291 --> 00:02:36.666
<b>to understand the Lord's many divine plays.</b>

34
00:02:36.666 --> 00:02:38.541
<b>For instance, at the time of birth,</b>

35
00:02:38.541 --> 00:02:40.541
<b>in His complete Vishnu form,</b>

36
00:02:40.541 --> 00:02:46.000
<b>with four arms, adorned with </b>
<b>all weapons and ornaments,</b>

37
00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:50.458
<b>He appeared in that prison </b>
<b>before Devaki and Vasudeva.</b>

38
00:02:50.458 --> 00:02:51.291
<b>Not only this,</b>

39
00:02:51.291 --> 00:02:53.791
<b>after manifesting in this avatar,</b>

40
00:02:53.791 --> 00:02:58.750
<b>He told His parents about their previous births</b>

41
00:02:58.750 --> 00:03:01.708
<b>and explained the purpose of His avatar.</b>

42
00:03:01.708 --> 00:03:03.291
<b>As a young boy,</b>

43
00:03:03.291 --> 00:03:09.708
<b>holding up the Govardhan mountain </b>
<b>on His little finger for 7 days and 7 nights,</b>

44
00:03:09.708 --> 00:03:14.708
<b>or as a small infant, slaying </b>
<b>the demoness Putana.</b>

45
00:03:14.708 --> 00:03:18.583
<b>Think about how captivating these </b>
<b>divine plays of Krishna are...</b>

46
00:03:18.583 --> 00:03:19.458
<b>'Krishna'</b>

47
00:03:19.458 --> 00:03:25.000
<b>itself means 'one who attracts everyone'.</b>

48
00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:29.750
<b>That's why even 5000 years </b>
<b>after the Mahabharata,</b>

49
00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:35.750
<b>His words still echo throughout </b>
<b>the world, echo in your mind.</b>

50
00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:42.041
<b>And this attraction inspires humans </b>
<b>to surrender to Him, to merge with Him, </b>

51
00:03:42.041 --> 00:03:45.375
<b>inspires them to attain Him.</b>

52
00:03:45.375 --> 00:03:50.500
<b>This was also one of Krishna's purposes</b>
<b>in displaying these divine plays – </b>

53
00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:54.458
<b>that whoever hears them </b>
<b>becomes attracted to Him,</b>

54
00:03:54.458 --> 00:03:57.041
<b>becomes eager to know about Him,</b>

55
00:03:57.041 --> 00:03:58.333
<b>and ultimately</b>

56
00:03:58.333 --> 00:04:05.291
<b>becomes free from the bonds of material </b>
<b>life through the path of surrender and devotion.</b>

57
00:04:05.291 --> 00:04:06.125
<b>And</b>

58
00:04:06.125 --> 00:04:11.875
<b>to offer this opportunity to everyone.</b>
<b>Krishna performs these divine plays,</b>

59
00:04:11.875 --> 00:04:14.875
<b>takes birth like this.</b>

60
00:04:19.791 --> 00:04:28.041
<b>Not just for protecting devotees, destroying evil, </b>
<b>and establishing dharma –</b>

61
00:04:28.041 --> 00:04:32.375
<b>taking avatar here has another purpose:</b>

62
00:04:32.375 --> 00:04:42.375
<b>to free you from this material world, from </b>
<b>the bonds of karma of sin and virtue.</b>

63
00:04:42.375 --> 00:04:45.416
<b>In this age,</b>

64
00:04:45.416 --> 00:04:47.083
<b>in this life,</b>

65
00:04:47.083 --> 00:04:50.000
<b>I performed many divine plays</b>

66
00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:56.291
<b>that were impossible from a material perspective.</b>

67
00:04:56.291 --> 00:05:04.958
<b>My appearance in the prison before </b>
<b>my parents in Vishnu form,</b>

68
00:05:04.958 --> 00:05:13.708
<b>lifting the entire Govardhan mountain </b>
<b>on just a small finger in my youth,</b>

69
00:05:13.708 --> 00:05:23.125
<b>slaying demons who came in disguise </b>
<b>to harm me even as an infant.</b>

70
00:05:23.125 --> 00:05:31.125
<b>These divine plays weren't meant to</b>
<b>remain mere historical events;</b>

71
00:05:31.125 --> 00:05:32.166
<b>rather,</b>

72
00:05:32.166 --> 00:05:36.875
<b>the main purpose of these miracles</b>

73
00:05:36.875 --> 00:05:43.500
<b>was to give humanity a glimpse</b>
<b>of my divine form,</b>

74
00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:49.416
<b>so that devotion towards me awakens within you.</b>

75
00:05:49.416 --> 00:05:56.083
<b>So that you receive a signal </b>
<b>that beyond everyday material life,</b>

76
00:05:56.083 --> 00:06:05.083
<b>there are many spiritual truths </b>
<b>yet to be known to you.</b>

77
00:06:05.083 --> 00:06:14.541
<b>Your attraction towards me will inspire </b>
<b>you to know these spiritual truths.</b>

78
00:06:14.541 --> 00:06:17.250
<b>And consequently,</b>

79
00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:22.750
<b>the level of your personal life will keep elevating.</b>

80
00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:26.833
<b>When you see from a spiritual perspective,</b>

81
00:06:26.833 --> 00:06:36.208
<b>all things that cause you pain, such </b>
<b>as hatred, jealousy, lust...</b>

82
00:06:36.208 --> 00:06:39.458
<b>you'll begin to rise above these.</b>

83
00:06:39.458 --> 00:06:45.541
<b>And as you begin to merge with me,</b>

84
00:06:45.541 --> 00:06:51.500
<b>many transcendental layers of </b>
<b>your existence will keep unfolding.</b>

85
00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:56.708
<b>You'll begin to understand your eternal soul form,</b>

86
00:06:56.708 --> 00:06:58.250
<b>and then</b>

87
00:06:58.250 --> 00:07:03.375
<b>when the end of this material life approaches,</b>

88
00:07:03.375 --> 00:07:07.875
<b>there will be neither difficulty nor pain.</b>

89
00:07:07.875 --> 00:07:08.833
<b>Rather,</b>

90
00:07:08.833 --> 00:07:17.958
<b>your faith in this spiritual truth will determine </b>
<b>your path after physical death.</b>

91
00:07:17.958 --> 00:07:20.791
<b>And a time will come</b>

92
00:07:20.791 --> 00:07:25.375
<b>when you'll be completely liberated</b>

93
00:07:25.375 --> 00:07:30.291
<b>and finally attain me.</b>

94
00:07:30.291 --> 00:07:34.458
<b>You will have merged with me.</b>

95
00:07:34.458 --> 00:07:37.500
<b>This indeed is the path to liberation.</b>

96
00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:38.666
<b>Come,</b>

97
00:07:38.666 --> 00:07:40.916
<b>walk this path.</b>

98
00:07:40.916 --> 00:07:44.375
<b>I myself invite you.</b>

99
00:07:48.833 --> 00:07:56.458
<b>One who knows the divine nature</b>
<b>of my birth and actions</b>

100
00:07:56.458 --> 00:08:03.083
<b>doesn't take rebirth in this </b>
<b>material world after death,</b>

101
00:08:03.083 --> 00:08:04.208
<b>but</b>

102
00:08:04.208 --> 00:08:08.125
<b>attains me instead.</b>

103
00:08:08.125 --> 00:08:10.875
<b>This too is a purpose</b>

104
00:08:10.875 --> 00:08:13.916
<b>of my taking birth here.</b>

105
00:08:13.916 --> 00:08:19.708
<b>Freedom from life's bondage is one destination,</b>

106
00:08:19.708 --> 00:08:22.166
<b>but remember,</b>

107
00:08:22.166 --> 00:08:27.875
<b>merely walking on this path</b>
<b>of surrender towards me</b>

108
00:08:27.875 --> 00:08:32.083
<b>will make your life beautiful.</b>

109
00:08:32.083 --> 00:08:40.166
<b>Every step taken on this path will </b>
<b>bring sanctity to your family.</b>

110
00:08:40.166 --> 00:08:42.208
<b>For instance,</b>

111
00:08:42.208 --> 00:08:45.625
<b>when walking on this path of devotion,</b>

112
00:08:45.625 --> 00:08:54.208
<b>when the family sits together discussing </b>
<b>my divine nature and my divine plays,</b>

113
00:08:54.208 --> 00:09:00.000
<b>an attraction towards spirituality </b>
<b>will awaken in all.</b>

114
00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:07.750
<b>And just this foundation alone will elevate </b>
<b>the consciousness of your entire family.</b>

115
00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:09.291
<b>Think,</b>

116
00:09:09.291 --> 00:09:14.083
<b>if family members are</b>
<b>inspired towards spirituality,</b>

117
00:09:14.083 --> 00:09:16.916
<b>attracted towards me,</b>

118
00:09:16.916 --> 00:09:24.666
<b>can discord or unrest ever remain between them?</b>

119
00:09:24.666 --> 00:09:26.291
<b>No.</b>

120
00:09:26.291 --> 00:09:37.458
<b>Because they will realize that all this is </b>
<b>trivial compared to their real spiritual existence.</b>

121
00:09:37.458 --> 00:09:39.333
<b>Therefore,</b>

122
00:09:39.333 --> 00:09:46.833
<b>encourage family discussions about </b>
<b>my teachings and my life.</b>

123
00:09:46.833 --> 00:09:47.791
<b>This way,</b>

124
00:09:47.791 --> 00:09:51.791
<b>not only will the family's spiritual elevation occur,</b>

125
00:09:51.791 --> 00:09:58.333
<b>but all family members will also learn many </b>
<b>invaluable qualities</b>

126
00:09:58.333 --> 00:10:06.125
<b>like compassion, forgiveness, and selfless </b>
<b>love from my personality for this life too.</b>

127
00:10:06.125 --> 00:10:10.541
<b>And if ever circumstances of disagreement arise,</b>

128
00:10:10.541 --> 00:10:18.083
<b>these very values will help reawaken mutual love.</b>

129
00:10:18.083 --> 00:10:20.250
<b>For example,</b>

130
00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:24.416
<b>maintaining patience during disputes,</b>

131
00:10:24.416 --> 00:10:29.750
<b>awakening forgiveness within </b>
<b>when others make mistakes,</b>

132
00:10:29.750 --> 00:10:37.208
<b>not harboring ill feelings over material things by considering them trivial.</b>

133
00:10:37.208 --> 00:10:39.708
<b>The ultimate purpose is that</b>

134
00:10:39.708 --> 00:10:46.000
<b>you know my truth and become</b>
<b>free from this bondage of birth.</b>

135
00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:47.166
<b>But</b>

136
00:10:47.166 --> 00:10:53.958
<b>the long path to reach there is </b>
<b>also extremely beautiful and beneficial.</b>

137
00:10:53.958 --> 00:10:56.125
<b>Not just for you,</b>

138
00:10:56.125 --> 00:10:56.833
<b>but</b>

139
00:10:56.833 --> 00:11:00.375
<b>for the entire family too.</b>

140
00:11:00.375 --> 00:11:08.666
<b>You too walk this path, and try </b>
<b>to bring the family along.</b>

141
00:11:08.666 --> 00:11:10.166
<b>Come.</b>

142
00:11:15.041 --> 00:11:21.958
<b>One who knows the divine nature </b>
<b>of my birth and divine plays</b>

143
00:11:21.958 --> 00:11:23.458
<b>ultimately</b>

144
00:11:23.458 --> 00:11:30.125
<b>attains me and becomes free</b>
<b>from this bondage of birth.</b>

145
00:11:30.125 --> 00:11:31.000
<b>But</b>

146
00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:35.791
<b>this isn't the only purpose of my divine plays.</b>

147
00:11:35.791 --> 00:11:43.791
<b>All these plays also tell you about </b>
<b>many principles and purposes of life.</b>

148
00:11:43.791 --> 00:11:47.625
<b>My stories aren't just for entertainment,</b>

149
00:11:47.625 --> 00:11:48.375
<b>but</b>

150
00:11:48.375 --> 00:11:59.375
<b>they'll inspire you to view and resolve professional </b>
<b>life's complexities from a spiritual perspective.</b>

151
00:11:59.375 --> 00:12:07.083
<b>The only requirement is that you change your </b>
<b>perspective slightly.</b>

152
00:12:07.083 --> 00:12:08.791
<b>For instance,</b>

153
00:12:08.791 --> 00:12:12.000
<b>my lifting of Govardhan mountain.</b>

154
00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:19.458
<b>I lifted that mountain to save Vrindavan's </b>
<b>people from fierce rain's fury.</b>

155
00:12:19.458 --> 00:12:24.750
<b>When all people stood safely </b>
<b>in that mountain's shadow,</b>

156
00:12:24.750 --> 00:12:29.375
<b>their faith in me became stronger.</b>

157
00:12:29.375 --> 00:12:33.375
<b>They began to believe that in difficult times,</b>

158
00:12:33.375 --> 00:12:37.708
<b>there is someone who will help them.</b>

159
00:12:37.708 --> 00:12:42.958
<b>Don't you too lead people in professional life?</b>

160
00:12:42.958 --> 00:12:47.041
<b>Have you ever lifted a Govardhan mountain?</b>

161
00:12:47.041 --> 00:12:55.625
<b>That is, have you voluntarily stepped forward to</b>
<b>save people from some heavy problem?</b>

162
00:12:55.625 --> 00:12:58.458
<b>This indeed is the lesson of leadership.</b>

163
00:12:58.458 --> 00:13:00.583
<b>In times of heavy problems,</b>

164
00:13:00.583 --> 00:13:05.875
<b>people need a protector, not a critic.</b>

165
00:13:05.875 --> 00:13:10.958
<b>If your colleagues are stuck in some dire problem,</b>

166
00:13:10.958 --> 00:13:16.583
<b>help them lift their Govardhan mountain.</b>

167
00:13:16.583 --> 00:13:19.708
<b>Their faith in you will awaken,</b>

168
00:13:19.708 --> 00:13:26.458
<b>and going forward, they will follow </b>
<b>your directions wholeheartedly.</b>

169
00:13:26.458 --> 00:13:31.958
<b>My appearing in divine form inside the prison,</b>

170
00:13:31.958 --> 00:13:37.666
<b>informing my parents about this birth's purpose</b>

171
00:13:37.666 --> 00:13:41.375
<b>is certainly a miraculous event.</b>

172
00:13:41.375 --> 00:13:42.333
<b>But</b>

173
00:13:42.333 --> 00:13:46.291
<b>if you look beyond this, you'll know</b>

174
00:13:46.291 --> 00:13:51.625
<b>that this event tells you about spiritual truth,</b>

175
00:13:51.625 --> 00:13:59.041
<b>a truth and a purpose beyond this material life.</b>

176
00:13:59.041 --> 00:14:00.458
<b>Think,</b>

177
00:14:00.458 --> 00:14:05.416
<b>do you view professional life from </b>
<b>a spiritual perspective?</b>

178
00:14:05.416 --> 00:14:10.708
<b>Is your purpose merely promotion </b>
<b>and higher salary,</b>

179
00:14:10.708 --> 00:14:13.833
<b>or somewhere far above this materiality,</b>

180
00:14:13.833 --> 00:14:17.541
<b>is your purpose that organization's success,</b>

181
00:14:17.541 --> 00:14:22.375
<b>and through this success ensuring</b>

182
00:14:22.375 --> 00:14:25.500
<b>that all employees' lives become easier,</b>

183
00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:29.458
<b>the organization's customers' lives </b>
<b>become simpler too.</b>

184
00:14:29.458 --> 00:14:30.791
<b>Think,</b>

185
00:14:30.791 --> 00:14:33.833
<b>your purpose isn't just a job,</b>

186
00:14:33.833 --> 00:14:37.000
<b>but far higher than this.</b>

187
00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:39.750
<b>These are just some examples.</b>

188
00:14:39.750 --> 00:14:41.333
<b>But</b>

189
00:14:41.333 --> 00:14:45.708
<b>as you become attracted towards me,</b>

190
00:14:45.708 --> 00:14:48.458
<b>begin to know about me,</b>

191
00:14:48.458 --> 00:14:52.291
<b>your spiritual strength will also increase.</b>

192
00:14:52.291 --> 00:14:56.791
<b>Then workplace problems </b>
<b>will start seeming simple,</b>

193
00:14:56.791 --> 00:14:58.708
<b>instead of competition,</b>

194
00:14:58.708 --> 00:15:02.458
<b>you'll begin to know the importance </b>
<b>of mutual cooperation.</b>

195
00:15:02.458 --> 00:15:05.500
<b>In a colleague, you'll begin </b>
<b>to see not a competitor,</b>

196
00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:06.166
<b>but</b>

197
00:15:06.166 --> 00:15:13.291
<b>a spiritual personality just like yourself.</b>

198
00:15:13.291 --> 00:15:18.666
<b>Spirituality isn't just effective in </b>
<b>personal or social life,</b>

199
00:15:18.666 --> 00:15:23.250
<b>but equally effective for professional life too.</b>

200
00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:25.666
<b>Reflect on this.</b>

201
00:15:25.666 --> 00:15:30.333
<b>Understand my life and my teachings.</b>

202
00:15:30.333 --> 00:15:36.250
<b>Make your professional life </b>
<b>smooth and progressive.</b>

